527 0 obj
<<
/A 1336 0 R
/Alt (Panel A shows a dot and box plot comparing Shannon diversity index across time points and treatments \(placebo and VSL#3\). Panel B presents a principal coordinates analysis \(PCoA\) scatterplot showing microbiome beta diversity clustering by time and treatment. Panel C displays a stacked bar chart of relative abundances for bacterial genera in each treatment group and time point. Panel D is a volcano plot comparing log-two fold changes and significance of different amplicon sequence variants \(ASVs\) between placebo and VSL#3 treatments, with labeled taxa. Panel E shows a volcano plot of ASV differential abundance between non-responders and responders, highlighting taxa with significant differences.)
/K [9 1337 0 R]
/P 149 0 R
/Pg 47 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 3)
/Type /StructElem
